WEBVTT

00:00:26.464 --> 00:00:31.210
He was, of course, foremost,
a very, very, very great scientist.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.976
He was an actor. You saw him act.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.658
I also had the good fortune
to be in those lectures,

00:00:37.682 --> 00:00:38.976
up in the balcony.

00:00:39.536 --> 00:00:40.742
They were fantastic.

00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:43.060
He was a philosopher.

00:00:43.631 --> 00:00:44.801
He was a drum player.

00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:46.784
He was a teacher par excellence.

00:00:48.483 --> 00:00:51.140
Richard Feynman was also a showman,

00:00:51.164 --> 00:00:52.727
an enormous showman.

00:00:52.751 --> 00:00:55.186
He was brash, irreverent.

00:00:56.186 --> 00:01:00.976
He was full of macho,
a kind of macho one-upmanship.